  "description": "<p>Rothco's Soft Shell Gloves are engineered to provide superior protection against cold and wet weather, making them an essential accessory for outdoor activities. Constructed with advanced 4-way stretch fabric, these outdoor gloves offer a perfect fit that moves with you. The tactical gloves are lined with soft micro fleece, providing added warmth and comfort. The wind and waterproof breathable PU membrane ensures your hands stay dry and warm, even in harsh conditions. The material on the palms and index fingers enhances manual dexterity, allowing you to perform tasks with precision and ease. Ribbed knit cuffs at the wrist provide a secure fit, keeping the elements out and the warmth in. Whether you're hiking, skiing, or working outdoors, Rothco's Soft Shell Gloves deliver unmatched protection and comfort. These soft shell gloves are designed to withstand the rigors of outdoor use while maintaining flexibility and tactile sensitivity.</p>",
